<title>UKRAINE: Hryvnia edged down to 1.874 per dlr in Kiev.</title>
<headline>Hryvnia edged down to 1.874 per dlr in Kiev.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hryvnia edged down to 1.874 per dollar on the Ukrainian Interbank Currency Exchange from 1.872 at the previous session.</p>
<p>				    November 27	  November 26</p>
<p> Hryvnia rate to dollar	  1.874		  1.872</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $11,37 million	   $3,37 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
